drafts, and is probably best avoided when you’re trying to get your first thoughts down on the page. It’s more likel
y to be something you would want to think about in the editing stages, when your mind is less focused on your own unders
tanding of the content, and more focused on your product draft, where you can best facilitate your readers’ understand
