e even a rejection. So, rule one: commas indicate dependent clauses . Along the same lines, rule two: commas separate in
troductory elements . Students occasionally omit these commas. •  Conversely, using the latter substrate had definit
e advantages. •  Consequently, it is recommended that this approach should be taken. Introductory elements seem inco
