gories, then a comma is not required, as in the example offered below. A new silicon container was used. These aren’t 
the only five rules about commas, but they’re perhaps five of the most important ones when it comes to maintaining cla
rity using the most common functions for someone in your position. Common comma errors We have already discussed the dam
age that can be caused by omitted commas in a lengthy sentence. The next most common types of comma error are as follows
